        <terms:source xml:lang="es">LOPDP, art. 69</terms:source>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Correspondences with the DPV: is the same as dpv:DataProcessor. Bridge with the GDPR: is close to gdprtext:Processor (through dpv:DataProcessor).</rdfs:comment>
