        <OntologiaLOPDP:segmented_into_the_following_international_cases rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/franc/ontologies/2023/9/OntologiaLOPDP#legal_institutions001"/>
        <OntologiaLOPDP:General_detail>Las instituciones legales pueden hacer uso de los datos del titular en procesos de investigación sin el consentimiento de este último.</OntologiaLOPDP:General_detail>
        <OntologiaLOPDP:Legal_institutions_detail>In the event that a legal institution requests legal action on the data in an international transfer, it may do so.</OntologiaLOPDP:Legal_institutions_detail>
        <rdfs:label>legal institutions001</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/franc/ontologies/2023/9/OntologiaLOPDP#legal_interest001 -->


    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/franc/ontologies/2023/9/OntologiaLOPDP#legal_interest001">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/franc/ontologies/2023/9/OntologiaLOPDP#Legal_interest_in_verification"/>
        <OntologiaLOPDP:the_verification_covers_aspects_such_as rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/franc/ontologies/2023/9/OntologiaLOPDP#legal_interest001"/>
        <OntologiaLOPDP:General_detail>It is the way in which the data is treated, it must be treated and therefore transferred only when strictly necessary. In addition, the presence of threats is verified.</OntologiaLOPDP:General_detail>
        <OntologiaLOPDP:Public_interest_detail>Information</OntologiaLOPDP:Public_interest_detail>
        <OntologiaLOPDP:Specific_threats>Threats that may affect the legitimate interest of a transfer of information</OntologiaLOPDP:Specific_threats>
        <OntologiaLOPDP:Vital_interest_detail_of_another_person>Vital information about another person</OntologiaLOPDP:Vital_interest_detail_of_another_person>
        <rdfs:label>legal interest001</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/franc/ontologies/2023/9/OntologiaLOPDP#legal_relationship001 -->


