        <OntologiaLOPDP:General_detail>When the connection of data to a database is required and there is an agreement between the data controller and the data subject, this exception may be used.</OntologiaLOPDP:General_detail>
        <rdfs:label>legal relationship001</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


