        <OntologiaLOPDP:General_detail>It is used as a method of communication with the owner when their personal data has been affected in any way.</OntologiaLOPDP:General_detail>
        <OntologiaLOPDP:Preservation_time>The data to be transferred must be stored for a certain period of time.</OntologiaLOPDP:Preservation_time>
        <OntologiaLOPDP:Secrecy_of_communications>Data must be subject to secrecy in communications.</OntologiaLOPDP:Secrecy_of_communications>
        <OntologiaLOPDP:Security_notification_of_infringement>5 days</OntologiaLOPDP:Security_notification_of_infringement>
        <OntologiaLOPDP:time_of_a_vulnerability_notification>3 days</OntologiaLOPDP:time_of_a_vulnerability_notification>
        <rdfs:label>notification001</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


