        <ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales:are_composed_of rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#turnover"/>
        <ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales:description>Dentro de está clase se detalla los términos con los que se puede encontrar dentro de ontología</ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales:description>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Dentro de está clase se detalla los términos con los que se puede encontrar dentro de ontología</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Dentro de está clase se detalla los términos con los que se puede encontrar dentro de ontología</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>terminología</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#territorial_application -->


    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#territorial_application">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#Territorial"/>
        <ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales:the_law_applies_in rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#data_processing"/>
        <ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales:the_law_applies_in rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#location_of_the_personal_data_protection_system_members"/>
        <ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales:scope_of_legislation>The Organic Law on Personal Data Protection will apply in certain scenarios, notwithstanding the existence of other international rules or regulations, i.e., the Organic Law on Personal Data Protection will apply regardless of any other international regulations that may exist.</ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales:scope_of_legislation>
        <rdfs:label>territorial application</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#transparency -->


    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#transparency">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#Transparency"/>
        <ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales:description>The processing of personal data must be transparent, therefore, all information on this process must be easily accessible and understandable, using simple and clear language.</ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales:description>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The processing of personal data must be transparent, therefore, all information on this process must be easily accessible and understandable, using simple and clear language.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">The processing of personal data must be transparent, therefore, all information on this process must be easily accessible and understandable, using simple and clear language.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>transparency</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#turnover -->


    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#turnover">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#Turnover"/>
        <ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales:description>This refers to the total income generated by the sale of products and the rendering of services carried out by commercial entities during the last fiscal year corresponding to their activities, which is calculated by deducting Value Added Tax (VAT) and other taxes directly related to economic operations.</ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales:description>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">This refers to the total income generated by the sale of products and the rendering of services carried out by commercial entities during the last fiscal year corresponding to their activities, which is calculated by deducting Value Added Tax (VAT) and other taxes directly related to economic operations.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">This refers to the total income generated by the sale of products and the rendering of services carried out by commercial entities during the last fiscal year corresponding to their activities, which is calculated by deducting Value Added Tax (VAT) and other taxes directly related to economic operations.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>turnover</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


