    <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#Data_processing">
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Correspondences with the DPV: is the same as dpv:Processing. Bridge with the GDPR: is close to gdprtext:AutomatedProcessing (through dpv:Processing); is close to gdprtext:Processing (through dpv:Processing).</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Correspondencias con el DPV: es igual a dpv:Processing. Puente con el GDPR: se parece a gdprtext:AutomatedProcessing (por dpv:Processing); se parece a gdprtext:Processing (por dpv:Processing).</rdfs:comment>
